Comment: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:03.27,Main,,0,0,0,,{=860}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.48,0:00:03.45,Narrator,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,And so outside of certain areas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.45,0:00:05.81,Narrator,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,{\q2}we kicked off the Gin Tama anime series with a one \Nhour special full of non-stop laughs and excitement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.82,0:00:09.99,Narrator,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,This time, we'll be taking a trip back \Nto when Gin and I first met.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.31,0:01:58.98,Main,SHINPACHI'S FATHER,0,0,0,,A samurai's sword is not something \Nthat is kept in a sheath.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.98,0:02:02.06,Main,SHINPACHI'S FATHER,0,0,0,,It's something that you hold in your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.43,0:02:06.40,Main,SHINPACHI'S FATHER,0,0,0,,These days, samurai aren't needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:11.78,Main,SHINPACHI'S FATHER,0,0,0,,But no matter how much times change, \Nthere are things that people mustn't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.47,0:02:15.13,Main,SHINPACHI'S FATHER,0,0,0,,Even if there comes a time \Nwhen you must give up your sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.13,0:02:18.83,Main,SHINPACHI'S FATHER,0,0,0,,you must never lose \Nthe unwavering sword kept in your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.46,0:02:21.79,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.71,0:02:26.59,Main,SHINPACHI'S FATHER,0,0,0,,The cloudless Edo sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.59,0:02:29.46,Main,SHINPACHI'S FATHER,0,0,0,,I wish I could've seen it one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.43,0:02:32.09,Narrator,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,The land of the samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.09,0:02:35.82,Narrator,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,There was a time, long ago, \Nwhen our country was called by that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.47,0:02:40.45,Narrator,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,Those dream-filled blue skies \Nupon which the samurai once gazed,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.45,0:02:42.18,Narrator,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,are now filled with ships from strange worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.57,0:02:46.40,Narrator,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,The towns where the samurai \Nonce proudly walked
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:49.32,Narrator,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,are now filled with swaggering, arrogant aliens.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.32,0:02:51.32,Narrator,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,This is our world today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.32,0:02:53.81,Narrator,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,This is our city.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.86,0:02:58.50,Main,MANAGER,0,0,0,,No, you idiot! That's not the one! \NIt's right there, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.50,0:03:02.04,Main,MANAGER,0,0,0,,Nowadays even a chimpanzee could do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.04,0:03:04.79,Main,MANAGER,0,0,0,,You're human. You've been \Nworking here for more than a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.79,0:03:05.83,Main,MANAGER,0,0,0,,Why can't you do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.72,0:03:10.00,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I...I'm sorry. Swordsmanship is \Nthe only thing I've ever done...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.25,0:03:12.80,Main,MANAGER,0,0,0,,{\c&HF2F5F4&\3c&HF2F5F4&\4c&HF2F5F4&\t(23,149,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}Loser! You're still clinging to your sword?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.02,0:03:17.59,Main,MANAGER,0,0,0,,Samurai and swords are all ancient history now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.59,0:03:21.31,Main,MANAGER,0,0,0,,How long are you going to act \Nas if you're a samurai?! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.31,0:03:21.89,Main,AMANTO A,0,0,0,,Oh, come on now...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.40,0:03:24.35,Main,AMANTO A,0,0,0,,Just leave it at that, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.63,0:03:27.45,Main,AMANTO A,0,0,0,,Hey, kid, don't you bother with the register.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.45,0:03:28.35,Main,AMANTO A,0,0,0,,Just get me some milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.35,0:03:30.61,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Oh... All right. Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.61,0:03:33.86,Main,MANAGER,0,0,0,,Sir, you mustn't go so easy on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.86,0:03:36.31,Main,AMANTO A,0,0,0,,Nah, just that lately whenever I see a samurai,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.31,0:03:38.26,Main,AMANTO A,0,0,0,,I feel kind of sorry for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.73,0:03:45.16,Main,AMANTO A,0,0,0,,When we first came here, the samurai \Nwere always spoiling for a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.43,0:03:48.50,Main,AMANTO A,0,0,0,,But, now, it's as if we've lost \Nan irritable friend. It's lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.63,0:03:53.65,Main,AMANTO A,0,0,0,,So I end up wanting to mess with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.60,0:03:59.26,Thoughts,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,Twenty years ago, aliens called \Nthe Amanto suddenly came to Edo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.75,0:04:02.97,Thoughts,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,The rise of the Amanto led \Nto the decline of the samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:02.97,Secondary,MANAGER,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Shinpachi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.73,0:04:05.39,Thoughts,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,We were stripped away of our swords and status
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.39,0:04:07.98,Thoughts,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,and we abandoned our honor \Nand everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.35,0:04:10.57,Thoughts,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,No, it wasn't only the samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.57,0:04:13.48,Thoughts,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,It was everyone in this country...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.77,0:04:14.61,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.43,0:04:19.54,Thoughts,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,A samurai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.08,0:04:27.13,Main,AMANTO A,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.13,0:04:30.00,Main,AMANTO A,0,0,0,,Strapping on a wooden sword \Nin the age of the Sword Ban!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.34,0:04:35.77,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Blah blah blah. \NAre you in heat or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.77,0:04:40.09,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Look at what happened to my chocolate \Nparfait because of your fussing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.64,0:04:43.01,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,All of it spilled out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.39,0:04:46.35,Main,AMANTO B,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.35,0:04:48.02,Main,AMANTO C,0,0,0,,Who do you think we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.29,0:04:52.29,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,My doctor told me my blood \Nsugar level was too high...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.29,0:04:56.81,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,So I just have one parfait a week!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.24,0:05:04.66,Thoughts,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,He was too fierce to be called a samurai,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.32,0:05:08.54,Thoughts,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,but too focused...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.54,0:05:10.55,Thoughts,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,...to be called a thug.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.55,0:05:14.09,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Tell your manager that it tasted great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.76,0:05:28.03,Main,YASHICHI,0,0,0,,All right, all right, out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.03,0:05:29.93,Main,YASHICHI,0,0,0,,Oh! There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.93,0:05:33.19,Main,YASHICHI,0,0,0,,So you're the one who's waving around \Na wooden sword and causing a riot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.19,0:05:35.95,Main,YASHICHI,0,0,0,,All right, don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.63,0:05:35.95,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Hold on... Wait. You're mistaken!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.95,0:05:38.49,Main,OOKA,0,0,0,,Hey, Yashichi! Check inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.49,0:05:39.36,Main,YASHICHI,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.84,0:05:42.66,Main,YASHICHI,0,0,0,,Uh-oh... It's the ambassador from Chatoran.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.95,0:05:45.37,Main,YASHICHI,0,0,0,,This is an international incident...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.37,0:05:46.95,Main,YASHICHI,0,0,0,,Do you realize what you've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.28,0:05:49.55,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I told you, it wasn't me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.55,0:05:51.41,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,The man who did it already ran off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.41,0:05:53.96,Main,OOKA,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, that's what they always say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.96,0:05:57.38,Main,OOKA,0,0,0,,Next time make your excuses \Nafter you hide your weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.38,0:05:59.80,Main,OOKA,0,0,0,,I'm going to file a report. \NCome with us to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.02,0:06:01.80,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.31,0:06:03.55,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.55,0:06:08.18,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,It just doesn't feel right...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.71,0:06:11.23,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I get all cranky if I don't have some sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.65,0:06:15.44,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,How dare you make me take \Nthe blame, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:18.02,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Everything's a mess because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.38,0:06:19.60,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What an honest kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.60,0:06:21.90,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You came to give me back my wooden sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.90,0:06:26.02,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,It's okay. It's just something \NI bought on a school trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.02,0:06:27.16,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,That's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.16,0:06:29.54,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I just barely managed to get away from the cops!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.54,0:06:33.87,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I keep telling them they've got it wrong, \Nbut they won't listen to a samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.87,0:06:36.50,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,My manager even said that I was the murderer...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.50,0:06:38.50,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You got sacked, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.63,0:06:41.67,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,A clerk who can't use a cash register
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.67,0:06:44.44,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,is about as useless as a mom \Nwho can't make fried rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.44,0:06:46.87,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Just what did you say about my mother?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.87,0:06:49.81,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You're getting all worked up \Njust because you got fired...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.81,0:06:53.18,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Nowadays, there isn't anyone \Nwho will hire a samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.18,0:06:56.65,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to survive \Nfrom now on?! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.72,0:07:04.74,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Quit your whining, you four-eyed idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.17,0:07:07.45,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Don't think that you're \Nthe only one who's got problems!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.85,0:07:12.33,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,In this world, there are samurai \Nwho call cardboard boxes their homes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.33,0:07:15.50,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Can't you be more positive like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.50,0:07:18.00,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Do you even know the meaning \Nof the word "positive"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.00,0:07:19.85,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Oh. Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.01,0:07:24.05,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.85,0:07:26.05,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Why aren't you at work?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.43,0:07:28.11,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Ack! Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.11,0:07:29.22,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Oh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.22,0:07:33.22,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,What are you doing screwing around \Nnot working, you little punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.69,0:07:36.45,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Do you know what kind of \Ntrouble we're in this month?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.45,0:07:40.23,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Even your pathetic paycheck is crucial!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.52,0:07:42.11,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,W-Wait, Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.68,0:07:45.09,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,This is all his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.09,0:07:46.40,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.09,0:07:51.37,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Sorry, gotta catch a rerun \Nof a soap opera this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.29,0:08:01.79,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.79,0:08:08.50,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,That was my big intro scene, so I got \Na little excited... I kinda went overboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.50,0:08:09.59,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.95,0:08:13.81,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,If "sorry" was enough, we wouldn't have seppuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.81,0:08:17.60,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, our dojo may \Nnot be able continue to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.48,0:08:21.11,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,It's been twenty years \Nsince national isolation was lifted...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.62,0:08:27.11,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Amanto began to come here from far-off \Nplanets and Edo has grown beyond recognition...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.64,0:08:32.16,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,But samurai and swords... \NThose who once held power
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.16,0:08:33.95,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,are now dying out one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.55,0:08:37.34,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,The same goes for our dojo...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.34,0:08:40.76,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Because of the ban on swords, \Nall of our students have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.76,0:08:46.13,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Right now, the two of us take part-time \Njobs in order to try to keep it going.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.71,0:08:50.21,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Even so, we try to protect the dojo \Nthat our father left behind for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.21,0:08:52.76,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,We've been trying so hard until now, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.93,0:08:54.22,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Because of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.22,0:08:56.27,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,It's all over, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.82,0:08:59.69,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Calm down, Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.69,0:09:02.38,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Was your sister raised by gorillas?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.90,0:09:06.19,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Wait, wait! Calm down...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.19,0:09:09.28,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I can't commit seppuku, \Nbut I do clean up my own messes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.70,0:09:11.71,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,What is this? A business card?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.83,0:09:14.87,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Odd Jobs, Gintoki Sakata.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.33,0:09:19.88,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You can't be too picky \Nabout jobs these days, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.88,0:09:23.17,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,My business is to do whatever I'm asked to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:25.63,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I'm Mr. "Odd Jobs" Gin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.63,0:09:28.55,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,If you've got problems, \NI'll solve them, no matter what...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.55,0:09:31.19,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,You're the one who's causing us problems!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.19,0:09:33.01,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Find me a job, damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:34.39,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.39,0:09:39.44,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I can't find you a job, but I can teach you \Na chant so you won't be nervous at interviews...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.44,0:09:40.76,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,No thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.07,0:09:44.29,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Sis...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.86,0:09:49.24,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,It's just impossible to run \Na sword dojo in this day and age...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.06,0:09:53.87,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Swords won't ever be revived again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.87,0:09:57.08,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,We don't have anything to gain \Nby desperately protecting this dojo...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.83,0:09:59.75,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,This isn't about profit or gain...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.21,0:10:06.50,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Does a child really need a reason to protect \Nthe things that its parents cherished?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.84,0:10:11.05,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,But, Sis, what did Father ever do for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.26,0:10:16.26,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Today I'm definitely going to \Nmake you pay me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.59,0:10:18.98,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.98,0:10:20.51,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Now I'm really getting irritated!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.65,0:10:24.09,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Hey, are you in debt?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.09,0:10:28.37,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You're leading pretty dangerous lives, \Nfor a couple of kids...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.37,0:10:31.31,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,We didn't do it. It was Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.31,0:10:32.02,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.03,0:10:34.07,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,What the hell are you blabbering about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.74,0:10:36.87,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Hurry up and bring me my money, stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.87,0:10:40.08,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,I gotta get home, my favorite soap opera is on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.47,0:10:41.70,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, today is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.70,0:10:43.33,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.79,0:10:46.83,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,I've been waiting ever since \Nyour pop was still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.83,0:10:48.34,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,I'm starting to go bald!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.95,0:10:52.49,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,You promised that you'd sell \Nthe dojo if you couldn't pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.49,0:10:54.81,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,You're going to keep that promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.81,0:10:56.22,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Wait a moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.49,0:10:58.47,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Why?! That's good enough, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.47,0:11:01.31,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,You don't need to feel obligated \Nto your stupid father
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.58,0:11:03.81,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,who left you nothing but debt when he died!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.21,0:11:05.81,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Get rid of this dojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.55,0:11:10.30,Main,SUBORDINATE A,0,0,0,,You little... What the hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:11.07,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.47,0:11:12.82,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,You fool...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.82,0:11:15.24,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Do you think that I won't hurt you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.61,0:11:17.62,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,just because you're a woman?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.10,0:11:19.12,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.71,0:11:23.23,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.23,0:11:25.62,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Even though she was raised by \Ngorillas, she's still a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.50,0:11:33.11,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.11,0:11:36.26,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Does this dojo still have students?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.89,0:11:38.65,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Honestly, the lot of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.65,0:11:40.80,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Forget the dojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.10,0:11:45.52,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,But I'm going to make you work \Nto pay off your debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.90,0:11:52.15,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,I've started a new business.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.15,0:11:54.40,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,It's called High-Leg Shabu Shabu Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.40,0:11:56.89,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,H-High Leg?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.89,0:11:58.06,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Wh-Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.06,0:12:00.99,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Because I like girls in high-leg outfits, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.44,0:12:05.46,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Well, simply put, it's a flying nightclub.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.46,0:12:07.77,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Technically, they're prohibited in Edo now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.77,0:12:10.95,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,But if it's in the sky, it'll be out of sight \Nfrom government officials.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.95,0:12:12.50,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,I can do whatever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.50,0:12:16.51,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,It'll be shabu shabu time while I get to \Nstare at girls in high-leg outfits!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.51,0:12:20.43,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,I'll ensnare my customers with sleaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.34,0:12:26.18,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,I've gathered beauties from many worlds, \Nbut you'd be more than welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.18,0:12:30.65,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Well, it comes down to either \Nselling this dojo or selling yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.65,0:12:31.73,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Which will it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.08,0:12:33.25,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.25,0:12:34.38,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,She'd never...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:35.55,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,All right. I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:40.65,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,What a dutiful daughter you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.25,0:12:43.91,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Hold on... Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.50,0:12:45.74,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Why would you do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.13,0:12:47.96,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,We've done enough, haven't we?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.96,0:12:48.54,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.96,0:12:50.08,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:55.26,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Shin, it's as you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.26,0:12:59.05,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Nothing good will come from saving this dojo...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.05,0:13:00.09,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,...only pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.38,0:13:03.35,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,But it's also painful to let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.18,0:13:08.56,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,It's painful to keep or to discard \Nsomething that you can never get back...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.51,0:13:11.36,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,If it's going to be painful either way,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.25,0:13:15.48,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,I'd rather suffer trying to protect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.97,0:13:37.00,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,What the hell?! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.33,0:13:38.96,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,My stupid sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:40.74,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,She keeps talking about Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.74,0:13:43.14,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,What did baldy ever do for us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.14,0:13:45.43,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,He only played Othello with us once in a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.43,0:13:47.77,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Was your dad bald?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.77,0:13:49.93,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Well, he was mentally bald.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.93,0:13:52.36,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Hey, you're still here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.36,0:13:56.42,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,And why are you cooking in my house?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.42,0:14:00.65,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Well, I can't go on without eating \Nsomething sweet periodically.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.65,0:14:03.16,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Then make something easier!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.37,0:14:10.29,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you go after your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.79,0:14:13.44,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.44,0:14:15.29,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,It was her decision to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.38,0:14:19.76,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,She really is my Father's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.76,0:14:20.76,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,She's just like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.72,0:14:26.59,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Father was a good-natured person \Nwho always talked about duty and compassion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.59,0:14:30.72,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Because of that, he got taken \Nadvantage of and died in debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.51,0:14:33.98,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Why was he so careless?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.98,0:14:37.11,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I don't want to die with only \Ngrand principles to my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.93,0:14:40.36,Flashbacks,SHINPACHI'S FATHER,0,0,0,,But no matter how much times change,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:42.82,Flashbacks,SHINPACHI'S FATHER,0,0,0,,{\t(1855,0,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}there are things that people mustn't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.78,0:14:48.28,Flashbacks,OTAE,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\t(19,561,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H525252&\4c&H000000&)}Does a child really need a reason to protect \Nthe things that its parents cherished?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.39,0:14:52.64,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,That kind of thinking only gets \Nin the way nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:55.21,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I plan on living smarter and longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.21,0:14:56.67,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.67,0:15:01.76,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,But you don't seem very smart to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.55,0:15:07.34,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Samurai don't need a reason to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:11.60,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,If they have something they have to protect, \Nthey should draw their sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.65,0:15:14.18,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Do you love your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.32,0:15:20.48,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,"Watch the beautiful sunset from heaven,"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.82,0:15:22.73,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,"first boat leaves this afternoon at four."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.12,0:15:23.78,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.78,0:15:27.12,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,The ship's about to leave! \NCan't you go any faster?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.12,0:15:30.22,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Hey, safety first. That's my motto...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.22,0:15:31.20,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,It'll also hurt if we crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.51,0:15:33.22,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Now's not the time to be saying that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.22,0:15:35.91,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Sis is in high-leg shabu shabu danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.91,0:15:39.08,Main,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,Hey! You, without the helmet, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.59,0:15:41.26,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.26,0:15:44.17,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,We don't need road traffic \Nlaws in this day and age.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.17,0:15:47.21,Main,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,That's true, but it'll hurt if you crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.21,0:15:48.89,Main,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,I'm just telling you because I'm concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.19,0:15:51.89,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I'm all right. I have a hard head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.89,0:15:53.15,Main,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,Huh?! What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.15,0:15:55.23,Main,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,I'm trying to be considerate!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.23,0:15:58.30,Main,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,It really hurts! It's terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.30,0:15:59.40,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.40,0:16:00.65,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I'm telling you that it's hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.52,0:16:05.78,Main,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,I've got a nose bleed! \NI've got a nose bleed! And at my age!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.42,0:16:09.78,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,The Shabu Shabu Heaven has taken off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.78,0:16:11.99,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,What are we going to do?! It's so high up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.07,0:16:14.91,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.91,0:16:17.09,Main,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,Damn him... Mocking me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.09,0:16:18.42,Main,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,After him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.01,0:16:18.42,Main,OFFICER B,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.25,0:16:24.76,Main,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.76,0:16:27.51,Main,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,Do you think that you can outrun the police?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.10,0:16:35.43,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,I'm Otae. Please treat me gently.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.75,0:16:39.03,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,I told you, that's not how you do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.03,0:16:41.40,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,You're supposed to show \Nmore cleavage there! Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.69,0:16:46.32,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,I've never had cleavage before in my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.32,0:16:49.70,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry. You couldn't show \Nany even if you wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.20,0:16:53.83,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Fine! Next we'll work on your technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.91,0:16:56.62,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,It's time to put on your high-leg outfit \Nand give us some shabu shabu heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.74,0:16:59.05,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Hold on... That cut is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.05,0:17:02.08,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,This cut is what we're going for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.87,0:17:04.88,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Put it on already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.34,0:17:10.38,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,If you've lost your nerve now, it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.96,0:17:15.22,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,If you think that I'm going to go easy on you just \Nbecause we're on prime-time, you're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.53,0:17:17.93,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,This is for your dojo. So buck up, little soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.93,0:17:29.61,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.81,0:17:33.37,Main,GORILLA MAN,0,0,0,,Hold on. What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.37,0:17:37.80,Main,SUBORDINATE B,0,0,0,,Boss! What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.80,0:17:40.58,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,A car crashed into us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.58,0:17:42.52,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,This is bad. It's a police car!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.52,0:17:44.63,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,The cops are onto us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.54,0:17:49.20,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It's just a rental.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.39,0:17:53.07,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Hello. Odd Jobs at your service!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.07,0:17:56.14,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Sis! You haven't put \Non that high-leg outfit yet, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.44,0:17:57.38,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Shin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.38,0:17:59.85,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.22,0:18:02.30,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,We've come to get my sister back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.30,0:18:03.65,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.65,0:18:06.90,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Don't any of you understand that it's too late already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.37,0:18:11.27,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Your dojo won't be any safer after this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.27,0:18:13.78,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I don't care about the dojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.29,0:18:18.29,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I want a dojo where my sister is always smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.29,0:18:20.75,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,If I have to see my sister cry...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.20,0:18:22.54,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I don't need the dojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.75,0:18:24.88,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Shin...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.33,0:18:29.38,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Fool! What can just the two of you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.38,0:18:30.71,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.67,0:18:34.33,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Hey, I'll distract 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.33,0:18:36.62,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Go find an escape pod or something \Nand get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.62,0:18:37.97,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Wh-What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.23,0:18:41.35,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You just think about protecting your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.98,0:18:44.14,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I'll protect what I want to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.14,0:18:46.52,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,What the hell are you going on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.52,0:18:47.69,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.11,0:18:52.03,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,All right! Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.03,0:18:53.49,Main,SUBORDINATES,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.49,0:18:54.87,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.87,0:18:55.91,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,H-His style is crazy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.96,0:18:57.53,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,...but strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.03,0:19:00.87,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Shinichi! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.54,0:19:03.12,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,It's "Shinpachi," you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.43,0:19:05.25,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.67,0:19:07.29,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Will he be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.94,0:19:10.03,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Why is he doing this for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.03,0:19:11.67,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.67,0:19:13.17,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,But he'll come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.69,0:19:16.18,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Because I sense it in him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.18,0:19:17.68,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,The thing that Father talked about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.54,0:19:24.02,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,He really came back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.02,0:19:27.55,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,That was tough! \NIt was far tougher than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.55,0:19:30.90,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Try a little harder! \NYou didn't even last a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.90,0:19:34.86,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You idiot! It's really tough to make a minute-long anime!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.11,0:19:37.11,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Just find an escape pod right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.32,0:19:41.12,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.76,0:19:43.07,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,The engine room?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:47.17,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,It's a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.97,0:19:49.96,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Let's end this game of tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.76,0:19:52.21,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,How pathetic...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.64,0:19:55.51,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,The samurai who once protected \Nthe country with their swords
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.91,0:19:59.76,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,are now good-for-nothings \Nwho can't even protect a single girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.44,0:20:03.58,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,There's nothing for you to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.58,0:20:07.44,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,This country... This sky, \Nthey all belong to us, the Amanto.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.83,0:20:10.07,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,The country? The sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.07,0:20:12.20,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You can have 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.20,0:20:14.99,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I'm busy protecting the things in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.73,0:20:19.95,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I don't know how many things \NI have failed to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.54,0:20:25.70,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I don't have anything left, but at least \Nif I find something falling before me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.38,0:20:27.83,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I want to pick it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.83,0:20:32.50,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,What pathetic warrior spirit... \NI've had enough of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:33.04,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.04,0:20:35.43,Main,STAFF A,0,0,0,,Hold on... Sir, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.43,0:20:37.95,Main,STAFF A,0,0,0,,What'll happen if we hit the you-know-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.95,0:20:39.63,Main,STAFF A,0,0,0,,We'll die along with the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.63,0:20:41.88,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,O-Oh no, I forgot...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.48,0:20:44.89,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Hey, he's climbing it! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.39,0:20:46.83,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.83,0:20:49.39,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,That's not good! \NThat's the ship's engine core.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.61,0:20:54.20,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What's precious to my client is precious to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.20,0:20:55.40,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,In order to protect them...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.79,0:20:57.03,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I'll do...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.36,0:20:59.53,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,...anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.49,0:21:06.50,Main,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,No! He really did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.88,0:21:17.44,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What is this floating sensation? I feel sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.44,0:21:19.38,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Is this thing falling?! Are we falling?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.82,0:21:32.98,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Luckily we were over the ocean, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.74,0:21:36.65,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,...who knows what would have happened if we had fallen on the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.08,0:21:40.36,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I've never seen such a crazy samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.36,0:21:41.18,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.37,0:21:44.11,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,In the end, he saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.62,0:21:47.20,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.00,0:21:52.00,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I aided in the arrest of ruffians \Nwho were disturbing the peace in Edo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.00,0:21:54.59,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You can let the fact \Nthat I borrowed a police car slide!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.59,0:21:57.42,Main,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,"Borrowed"? My car and I are a complete wreck!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.42,0:22:00.06,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You've always been a wreck! \NYou actually look even better like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.06,0:22:01.68,Main,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,Seriously?! What part?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.59,0:22:04.42,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Sis, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.42,0:22:05.52,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.69,0:22:09.68,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,You found something in him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.10,0:22:13.40,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Go and find your sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.98,0:22:16.53,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,I'll look for it my own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.53,0:22:19.20,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,It's all right. I won't do anything rash anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.20,0:22:22.95,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,I don't want to see you cry either.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.92,0:22:25.07,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Sis...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.85,0:22:28.52,Flashbacks,SHINPACHI'S FATHER,0,0,0,,Even if there comes a time \Nwhen you must give up your sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.52,0:22:32.16,Flashbacks,SHINPACHI'S FATHER,0,0,0,,you must never lose \Nthe unwavering sword kept in your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.07,0:22:36.46,Main,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.79,0:22:41.21,Main,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,What sort of soul does this guy have? \NIt's very difficult to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.68,0:22:45.39,Main,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,I think it's dim but it's definitely shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.47,0:22:51.59,Main,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,Right now, I think I'd like \Nto watch it shine for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.32,0:24:30.07,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Oh no! I forgot that Jump goes on sale today!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.40,0:24:32.03,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Should I use this opportunity to grow out of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.29,0:24:34.58,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,No! Men are boys at heart until they die!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.96,0:24:35.60,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,The next episode:
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.60,0:24:38.36,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,"Watch Out! Weekly Shonen JUMP Sometimes Comes Out on Saturdays!"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.31,0:24:55.01,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I wish I could shoot something \Nlike Getsuga Tensho, too...
Comment: 0,0:24:35.75,0:24:39.95,Main,,0,0,0,,{=861}===============================DIALOGUE============================ END
